OL,3,AHungary expels 10 Russian diplomats as
OL,4,Arelations worsen
OL,5,
OL,6,FHungarian Foreign Minister Anita Orban
OL,7,Fsays 10 Russian diplomats have been
OL,8,Fordered to leave Budapest for taking
OL,9,Fpart in "unacceptable" activities.
OL,11,F"This decision protects Hungary's
OL,12,Fsecurity and sovereignty," she wrote on
OL,13,Fsocial media, without giving details.
OL,15,FHungary was viewed as Russia's closest
OL,16,Fally in the European Union under Viktor
OL,17,FOrban for years, but since his election
OL,18,Fdefeat in April the new government has
OL,19,Fpivoted away from his pro-Kremlin
OL,20,Fstance.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
