OL,3,AHungary expels 10 Russian diplomats as
OL,4,Arelations worsen
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Hungarian foreign minister said the
OL,7,Fdecision to expel the diplomats "does
OL,8,Fnot imply breaking off diplomatic
OL,9,Frelations with Russia", but the foreign
OL,10,Fministry spokeswoman in Moscow said
OL,11,F"the response to the Russophobic lobby
OL,12,Fwill be harsh and painful".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
